# Check text files out with LF line endings on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows installs with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF
# on checkout. Prettier rejects CRLF, so on a default Windows setup
# `npm run format:check` - and with it `npm run check` - failed on a fresh
# clone before a single line had been edited. CI could not see it: the format
# check runs on Linux only.
#
# The scanner itself does not care which ending a file has, and
# tests/integration/fixtures.test.ts holds it to that on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
